    "name": "Fluffy's House",
    "steam_appid": 3505280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre</strong> : Social deduction game (Wargame)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Number of players</strong> : 4~12</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Story]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A house was built in a forest, where a spirit called \u201cFluffy\u201d lived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, there were some people who tried to take away the house of \u201cFluffy\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Rules]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The players are divided into two camps, \u201cFluffy\u201d and \u201cLumpy,\u201d and each camp aims for its own victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluffy\u201d wins by expelling all Lumpies, and \u2018Lumpy\u2019 attacks Fluffy so that the number of Fluffy's is equal to the number of Lumpies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, a player selects one \u201caction card\u201d in his/her possession. In the morning, players discuss with each other and decide who to expel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Features]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Three-story dwellings}</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players are randomly assigned a room at the beginning of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ladder may be necessary to get to someone's room. The position of the ladder changes randomly every night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{More than 17 different action cards}</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple options to choose from for the nightly action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Examples of Action Cards)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLadder switch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Removes a ladder from the residence, making it impossible to move from one floor to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMushroom Trap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who comes close to the trap will have mushrooms growing out of his/her head the next morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Detailed rule settings}</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following rules can be edited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting time/Time to choose the night's action /Kill on the first night/Number of cards in possession/The appearance of each action card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Other functions}</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute poses for reactions in the lobby and during meetings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Door design and character color can be changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Courtesy]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u52b9\u679c\u97f3\u30e9\u30dc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VSQ plus+</p>",
