paragraph\" >The player who comes close to the trap will have mushrooms growing out of his/her head the next morning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Detailed rule settings}</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following rules can be edited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeting time/Time to choose the night's action /Kill on the first night/Number of cards in possession/The appearance of each action card</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>{Other functions}</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute poses for reactions in the lobby and during meetings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Door design and character color can be changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>[Courtesy]</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u52b9\u679c\u97f3\u30e9\u30dc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VSQ plus+</p>",
    "short_description": "A werewolf game set in a mansion inhabited by fluffy spirits.Genre: Social deduction game (werewolf game)Number of players: 4 to 12\u2219 Random room assignments, move by ladder\u2219 Choose your night's action. (More than 17 different actions)Enjoy a werewolf game like never before!",
